      "content": "that's a good way to put it. i pretty much agree—it feels like things are changing way too fast. when u mention \"global homogenization,\" do u think that's mainly because of stuff like mass migration and people moving in and changing the local vibe, or is it more about the internet and tech? i'm trying to figure out if i should mention the impact of immigration in our core messaging.",
